  "facts": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Lake St. Clair is a private community in Franklin County, just about a mile west of the city of St. Clair.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakestclair-hoa.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Developed in the early 1960s by the Authorized Investors Group, the subdivision covers 450 acres, contains 1,352 lots, and stretches 23 miles of roads.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakestclair-hoa.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community’s centerpiece is Lake #1, a 60‑acre body of water that hosts boating, water‑skiing, and fishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakestclair-hoa.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "At one end of Lake #1 sits a marina and boat launch, while the opposite end offers a public beach for non‑waterfront owners.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakestclair-hoa.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Lakes 2, 3, and 4 are reserved for recreational use, but only trolling‑type motors are permitted on them.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakestclair-hoa.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The St. Clair Historical Museum, located in Franklin County, showcases local history and artifacts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
